{%- comment -%}
  Product / Offer / AggregateRating JSON-LD for the PDP.

  What already existed before this: FAQPage, emitted by sections/faq-accordion
  on the homepage and the product page. Nothing else. Shopify does not output
  Product schema for a theme — the theme has to — so until now the store gave
  Google no price, no availability and no rating, and could not qualify for a
  product rich result.

  Every value is read from the product. Nothing here is written by hand and
  nothing is inferred: no rating unless Judge.me has actually written one, no
  brand unless the vendor or the brand setting is filled, no SKU unless the
  variant carries one, no review count unless there are reviews.

  availability is derived from the variant rather than assumed, and priceValidUntil
  is deliberately absent: Google treats it as optional, and inventing a date is
  exactly the kind of unverifiable claim this theme refuses elsewhere.

  No gtin/mpn, and that is correct rather than incomplete. These mats have no
  manufacturer barcode — every variant's `barcode` is empty in the admin — so
  there is nothing truthful to put in either field, and both are optional for
  a Product rich result. The thing that actually wants an identifier answer is
  Google Merchant Center, and the property it wants (`identifier_exists: false`)
  is a *product feed* attribute, not schema.org vocabulary: emitting it here
  would be invalid markup, not a fix. It is set in the Google & YouTube sales
  channel instead — see the report's manual actions.

  ONE node. Duplicate or competing Product nodes on a page are worse than none,
  because Google picks arbitrarily between them. Judge.me can also emit product
  rich snippets from its own settings; if it is switched on there, one of the two
  should be turned off. That cannot be checked from here — see the report.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign brand = product.vendor | default: settings.brand_name
  assign n = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | default: 0
  assign avg = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating
  assign scale_max = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.scale_max | default: 5
  assign scale_min = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.scale_min | default: 1
-%}
{%- capture product_ld -%}
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Product",
  "name": {{ product.title | strip_html | json }},
  "url": {{ shop.url | append: product.url | json }},
  {%- if product.description != blank %}
  "description": {{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 5000 | json }},
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if product.images.size > 0 %}
  "image": [
    {%- for image in product.images limit: 5 -%}
      {{ image | image_url: width: 1600 | prepend: 'https:' | json }}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ],
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if brand != blank %}
  "brand": { "@type": "Brand", "name": {{ brand | json }} },
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if v.sku != blank %}
  "sku": {{ v.sku | json }},
  {%- endif %}
  {%- if n > 0 and avg %}
  "aggregateRating": {
    "@type": "AggregateRating",
    "ratingValue": {{ avg | json }},
    "reviewCount": {{ n | json }},
    "bestRating": {{ scale_max | json }},
    "worstRating": {{ scale_min | json }}
  },
  {%- endif %}
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "url": {{ shop.url | append: product.url | json }},
    "price": {{ v.price | divided_by: 100.0 | json }},
    "priceCurrency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
    "availability": {% if v.available %}"https://schema.org/InStock"{% else %}"https://schema.org/OutOfStock"{% endif %},
    "itemCondition": "https://schema.org/NewCondition",
    "seller": { "@type": "Organization", "name": {{ settings.brand_name | default: shop.name | json }} }
  }
}
{%- endcapture -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ product_ld }}</script>
